Package: utilscidados
Title: Internal Helper Functions for Data Work at Insper Cidades
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vinicius", "Oike",
           email = "viniciusor@insper.edu.br",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189"))
Description: Prepares datasets for publication on Insper's Dataverse
    and spatial layers for upload to Mapbox Studio. Exports tables and
    spatial data to several file formats, builds data dictionaries and
    README files, and manages the Dataverse metadata workbook.
